#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:22
#: 1921015a14d946a5bae66e62e5d629a7
msgid "Install Atom for Linux/Windows/MacOS"
msgstr "为 Linux/Windows/MacOS 安装 Atom"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:25
#: 2119cfe2c8644a95825457e3872946f6
msgid "Install Atom for Linux"
msgstr "为 Linux 安装 Atom"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:27
#: 5c3b9b30952a451dabee667d377fd91b
msgid ""
"The simplest way to install Atom in your Linux computer, you can go to "
"`https://atom.io <https://atom.io>`__ and downloading the .deb package for "
"Debian/Ubuntu machines, or .rpm package for Red Hat/CentOS/Fedora/SUSE "
"machines. Then run the following command to install it: - Debian and Ubuntu:"
" (deb)"
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上安装 Atom 最简单的方式是访问 `https://atom.io <https://atom.io>`__ 并下载适用于 "
"Debian/Ubuntu 的 .deb 包，或适用于 Red Hat/CentOS/Fedora/SUSE 的 .rpm 包，然后使用以下命令安装：-"
" Debian 和 Ubuntu：(deb)"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:35
#: d1b0c318a7de41aa993f39cbf82a2cd3
msgid "Red Hat/CentOS: (yum)"
msgstr "Red Hat/CentOS：(yum)"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:41
#: 3e121e40a1d84988a5b89ff224041d6f
msgid "Fedora: (dnf)"
msgstr "Fedora：(dnf)"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:47
#: 443e7971272a4dc195fcae9ee10f9028
msgid "SUSE: (zypp)"
msgstr "SUSE：(zypp)"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:54
#: 301286ede7ef47ebb3a55215823ef545
msgid "Install Atom for Windows"
msgstr "为 Windows 安装 Atom"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:56
#: 481d04aa26174f49803ab882f6cc4a3a
msgid ""
"Installing Atom should be fairly simple. Generally, you can go to "
"`https://atom.io <https://atom.io>`__ and you should see a download button. "
"After finishing download, run the .exe file. This setup program will install"
" Atom, add the atom and apm commands to your PATH, and create shortcuts on "
"the desktop and in the start menu."
msgstr ""
"安装 Atom 相当简单。通常您可以访问 `https://atom.io <https://atom.io>`__ 并点击下载按钮。下载完成后，运行 "
".exe 文件。安装程序将安装 Atom，并将 atom 和 apm 命令添加到 PATH，同时在桌面和开始菜单创建快捷方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:60
#: 153f61bd26974b6c8ea541cd0927eaa5
msgid "Install Atom for MacOS"
msgstr "为 MacOS 安装 Atom"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:62
#: 193295a1db7c4e09b22d3d47d1becfd5
msgid ""
"Atom follows the standard Mac zip installation process. You can either press"
" the download button from the `https://atom.io <https://atom.io>`__ site or "
"you can go to the Atom releases page to download the atom-mac.zip file "
"explicitly. Once you have that file, you can click on it to extract the "
"application and then drag the new Atom application into your "
"\"Applications\" folder."
msgstr ""
"Atom 遵循标准的 Mac zip 安装流程。您可以在 `https://atom.io <https://atom.io>`__ "
"点击下载按钮，或前往 Atom 发布页面明确下载 atom-mac.zip 文件。下载后点击该文件以解压应用程序，然后将新的 Atom "
"应用拖入「应用程序」文件夹即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:65
#: 4fba288b4e544a7db71b1b5eee584e6c
msgid "Configuring GitHub"
msgstr "配置 GitHub"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:67
#: c2e117566f214cd086f1deab4dffb428
msgid ""
"Press on GitHub tab then you should see a prompt like the following. Press "
"on the link to generate a token, then enter this token in the box. Your "
"GitHub account should now be linked with your Atom editor now."
msgstr ""
"点击 GitHub 标签页，您将看到如下提示。点击链接生成令牌，然后在框中输入该令牌。您的 GitHub 账户现在应已与 Atom 编辑器关联。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:73
#: 08788529c6794aab8c5ceae6557751d8
msgid ""
"You can visit the official GitHub manual for Atom `here <https://flight-"
"manual.atom.io/using-atom/sections/github-package/>`__ to start managing "
"your GitHub repositories from Atom."
msgstr ""
"您可以访问 Atom 的官方 GitHub 手册（`此处 <https://flight-manual.atom.io/using-"
"atom/sections/github-package/>`__），开始从 Atom 管理您的 GitHub 仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:76
#: e1f24e00b8f6458b9477b926f703fb71
msgid "Install Teletype package for real time collaboration"
msgstr "安装 Teletype 插件以进行实时协作"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:78
#: d75ca6de4fc94d9db62f404d7efa9b2b
msgid ""
"Teletype allows sharing or joining a portal for real time collaboration. To "
"install it, go to the menu bar *Packages->Settings View->Open*. Type in "
"\"Teletype\" in the box then install. Finally, you can see Teletype in the "
"menu *Packages* then you can *\"Join Portal\"* or *\"Share Portal\"*."
msgstr ""
"Teletype 允许共享或加入工作区进行实时协作。安装时，进入菜单栏 *Packages->Settings "
"View->Open*，在搜索框中输入「Teletype」后安装。安装完成后，可在 *Packages* 菜单中看到 Teletype，并可选择 "
"*「Join Portal」* 或 *「Share Portal」*。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-atom.rst:86
#: 764f463369ba48e2bcde148417de04a7
msgid ""
"The complete Atom manual is available `here <https://flight-"
"manual.atom.io/>`__."
msgstr "完整的 Atom 手册可在 `此处 <https://flight-manual.atom.io/>`__ 查阅。"
